# RDM over Art-Net: ArtRdm (0x8300), ArtTodRequest (0x8000), ArtTodData
# (0x8100) and ArtTodControl (0x8200). Ports are named as in ArtDmx: Net, then
# the low octet of the Port-Address.

# ArtRdm: GET DEVICE_INFO for port 0:0:1, the RDM message without its start code.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 83 00 0e 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 01 18 4c 55 12 34 56 78 7a 70 00 00 00 01 05 01 00 00 00 20 00 60 00 04 0b => rdm v14 rdmver 1 port 0:0:1 command 0; get tn 5 pid 0x0060

# ArtRdm on port 2:3:4, spare octets set: kept.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 83 00 0e 01 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 09 02 00 34 01 18 4c 55 12 34 56 78 7a 70 00 00 00 01 05 01 00 00 00 20 00 60 00 04 0b => rdm v14 rdmver 1 port 2:3:4 command 0; get tn 5 pid 0x0060

# ArtRdm carrying something that is not a whole RDM message: decoded as Art-Net, the RDM refused.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 83 00 0e 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 01 02 => rdm v14 rdmver 1 port 0:0:1 command 0; not rdm

# ArtTodRequest for 0:0:1 and 0:0:5.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 80 00 0e 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 02 01 05 => tod-request v14 net 0 command 0 addresses 0105

# ArtTodRequest padded to the full 32 addresses, as many senders do: the padding kept.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 80 00 0e 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 => tod-request v14 net 0 command 0 addresses 01; 31 trailing

# ArtTodControl: flush 1:2:3's table and discover again.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 82 00 0e 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 01 23 => tod-control v14 net 1 command 1 addresses 23

# ArtTodData: two devices on 0:0:1, the whole table in one block.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 81 00 0e 01 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 01 00 02 00 02 4c 55 12 34 56 78 4c 55 00 00 00 01 => tod-data v14 port 1 bind 1 response 0 port-address 0:0:1 total 2 block 0 uids 4c55:12345678 4c55:00000001

# ArtTodData: block 1 of a 300-device table.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 81 00 0e 01 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 01 01 2c 01 01 00 01 00 00 01 2c => tod-data v14 port 1 bind 1 response 0 port-address 0:0:1 total 300 block 1 uids 0001:0000012c

# ArtTodData: TodNak, no table.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 81 00 0e 01 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 ff 01 00 00 00 00 => tod-data v14 port 1 bind 1 response 255 port-address 0:0:1 total 0 block 0 uids none

# ArtTodData claiming three UIDs, carrying one.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 81 00 0e 01 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 01 00 03 00 03 4c 55 12 34 56 78 => error truncated need 46 at 34

# ArtTodRequest claiming two addresses, carrying one.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 80 00 0e 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 02 01 => error truncated need 26 at 25

# ArtRdm cut before its address.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 83 00 0e 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 => error truncated need 24 at 21
